    {
      "id": "samsungSwitch",
      "title": {
        "hanji": "三星手機仔齒盤切換"
      },
      "icon": {
        "ios": "arrow.triangle.2.circlepath",
        "android": "ic_swap"
      },
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": {
            "hanji": "因為三星手機無「預設齒盤」、「副齒盤」ê 功能，下跤是切換齒盤較利便 ê 方法。"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": {
            "hanji": "1. 揣著三星齒盤倒爿下跤 ê mài-kù 揤鈕，伊預設是語音輸入。"
          },
          "attachment": {
            "type": "image",
            "name": "faq_samsung_switch_1"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": {
            "hanji": "2. 揤牢 mài-kù 揤鈕，共伊改做「輸入法」。"
          },
          "attachment": {
            "type": "image",
            "name": "faq_samsung_switch_2"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": {
            "hanji": "3. 揤鈕會變做齒盤圖示，閣揤一下著會當切換齒盤矣。"
          },
          "attachment": {
            "type": "image",
            "name": "faq_samsung_switch_3"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
